{"decisions":["v5/v6 explicitly attest series int lengths. v1-v4 integer terminology leaves qualifier gaps: changing lengths are an explicit reconstruction for this restricted profile.","Existing SMA already supports dynamic windows; its ABI and implementation remain unchanged. Existing fixed-length contracts and state paths remain intact.","Only series-qualified length arguments select a new operation/contract; simple/const/input lengths use previous implementations.","Retain the last 100000 reached calls for extrema and last 100000 defined samples for statistics independently of selected length. Invalid/NA lengths fail before updating state; skipped calls do not update.","Statistics requery the newly selected window even on NA sources; extrema include NA holes but ignore them as candidates. Existing warmup rules apply.","One million shared storage cells; exact prefix statistics and logarithmic range extrema. Checkpoints store bounded samples/prefixes and validate consistency; previews modify overlays only.","Six existing signal WMA series-length rejection cases retain source and case IDs and become executions with independently expected all-NA output; the initial missing source prevents full warmup.","Exact TradingView equivalence remains a separate stage."],"evidence_sha256":"9efd3d40058507e8d211772feb019424be6d5af5f2dba39e4945a22b4b7aeb54","intentional_admissions":[{"case_id":"v1-series-length","corpus":"signals.json","expected_values":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"new_status":"executed","previous_status":"rejected","source_sha256":"49b6d56240cb2310cac692e0c5f346fd9ec41f2d6225a445d2ead7a54fe6df31"},{"case_id":"v2-series-length","corpus":"signals.json","expected_values":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"new_status":"executed","previous_status":"rejected","source_sha256":"39f70fbfb8b984b909c937612ab91cbe564bc17f4a343d55af4aef982bde1ffb"},{"case_id":"v3-series-length","corpus":"signals.json","expected_values":[null,null,null,null,nul